  "validation": [
    "all dimensions finite; radii non-negative; ratios between zero and one",
    "path stations ordered; duplicates allowed only for explicit corners",
    "no negative thickness or self intersection",
    "no channel or chine boundary crossing",
    "G1 minimum at ordinary joins and G2/fairness checks in fair regions",
    "parameter monotonicity property tests",
    "save reload save preserves geometry, semantics, units, and datum",
    "authored key stations remain distinct from derived and CNC stations"
